        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OK6040B, 6\" x 4\" Olive Knuckle Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Olive Knuckle Hinge is a Paumelle hinge where the knuckles have an olive shape. It is best suited for light-weight doors such as kitchen cabinet doors or bathroom vanity doors. This solid brass hinge measures 6 inches high and 4 inches wide. Founded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK6040-specifications.gif?v=1704354564\" width=\"308\" height=\"360\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana OK6038B Specifications\"></center>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which of the beautiful finishes you choose, the parts will still be made of high quality solid brass. The Deltana PVD Polished Brass Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana OK6040B Lightweight Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Wing Width: 3/4\"</li> \r\n<li>Overall Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<Li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screw: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK6040-specifications.pdf?v=1704262253\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OK6040B Hinge Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this olive knuckle hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-olive-kunckle-handing.gif?v=1704354537\"  width=\"411\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "6 Inch x 4 Inch Olive Knuckle Hinge, Deltana OK6040B",
                "description": "Deltana OK6040B 6 x 4 inch Olive Knuckle Hinge - The 6 inch solid brass Olive Knuckle Hinge is a full mortise, extruded hinge. It is made by Deltana, a leader in quality architectural hardware. Available in 11 finishes, this cabinet door hinge uses a #12x1-1/4 inch wood screw.",
                "keywords": "Deltana OK6040B olive knuckle hinges, deltana solid brass cabinet hinges, del-OK6040B, deltana OK6040 6 x 4 Olive Knuckle Hinges, 6 inch cabinet door hinges, deltana architectural hardware hinges, olive-shaped knuckles, stylish cabinet hinges, kitchen cabinet hinges, Deltana OK6040B lightweight Door Hinges, DEL-OK6040BU10B, DEL-OK6040BU14, DEL-OK6040BU15, DEL-OK6040BU15A, DEL-OK6040BU19, DEL-OK6040BU26, DEL-OK6040BU26D, DEL-OK6040BU3, DEL-OK6040BU5, DEL-OK6040BU3UNL, DEL-OK6040BCR003,"
